  "status": "accepted",
  "summary": "Immutable worker jobs retain existing oracle, attribution, acceptance, delivery and retry authority. Architecture-capable pins bind one exact slice and require native delivered-diff conformance. Coordinator integration slices separately charge resolution deltas from the automatic merge tree, record ordered parents/default ancestry and advance the chain anchor without laundering unaccepted commits. Review and delivery use the latest recorded anchor. Each authored or resolution slice has an exact allowlist and at most 500 source-line changes. Historical pins retain their meaning.",
